# fifo_child_resume_65_dies: 0x1028 = 65 names no child FIFO: past the 64 slots there is none. It clears bit 1 of the fault mask (the shift is by n mod 64) and resumes nothing, as a wake ignores the id; the device runs on (docs/testing.md, section 6.2). The name is kept from when the host died there.
